{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20972","headline":"开愁歌 · 李贺","name":"开愁歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风吹地百草乾，华容碧影生晚寒。\n我当二十不得意，一心愁谢如枯兰。\n衣如飞鹑马如狗，临岐击剑生铜吼。\n旗亭下马解秋衣，请贳宜阳一壶酒。\n壶中唤天云不开，白昼万里闲凄迷。\n主人劝我养心骨，莫受俗物相填𧱉","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}